  "id": "integration",
  "term": "integration",
  "definition": "In this learning-related context, integration refers to combining information from different senses into a single, more efficient perceptual process. This merging across sensory modalities can improve how a person perceives and responds to information, and it is distinct from simple sensitivity to input within one sense.",
